TI  - Batrachochytrium salamandrivorans in the Ruhr District, Germany: history, distribution, decline dynamics and disease symptoms of the salamander plague
AU  - Schulz, V
AU  - Schulz, A
AU  - Klamke, M
AU  - Preissler, K
