TI  - Trait-based ecology at large scales: Assessing functional trait correlations, phylogenetic constraints and spatial variability using open data
AU  - Wilkes, MA
AU  - Edwards, F
AU  - Jones, JI
AU  - Murphy, JF
AU  - England, J
AU  - Friberg, N
